Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉克森的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.52,0:00:18.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二十三集 停车场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I've looked under chairs ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:32.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I've looked under tables ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.92,0:00:35.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I've tried to find the key ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:38.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ To fifty million fables They call me the seeker... ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:42.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As the summer heat descended on Diddly Squat...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.00,0:00:42.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}夏日的炎热 已经降临迪丽斯库阿特农场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I've been searching low and high ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:47.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...Charlie retired to his office to get quotes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.96,0:00:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}查理回到办公室
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.76,0:00:50.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for building our new farm-shop car park.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.76,0:00:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}整理建造新农场商店停车场的报价
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.52,0:00:52.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I won't get to get what I'm after ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.68,0:00:54.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Till the day I die ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:57.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This was now extremely urgent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:57.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在这事非常紧急 因为夏天的游客已经到了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.40,0:01:02.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as the summer visitors had arrived and were whiling away the hours up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.40,0:01:04.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们在那里消磨时光 吃用我们的牛肉做的汉堡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.12,0:01:04.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}tucking into burgers made with our beef...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.68,0:01:05.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.68,0:01:05.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...and drinking not only my Hawkstone lager...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}特别菜单 上新啦!卡莱布苹果酒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们不仅喝 我的豪客斯通拉格啤酒...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:11.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.56,0:01:11.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 给您 请慢用 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:14.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...but also Kaleb's new Hawkstone Cider.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.52,0:01:14.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...还喝卡莱布的新豪客斯通苹果酒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:18.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- There you go. Enjoy. - Thank you very much, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.80,0:01:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 给您 请慢用 - 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.16,0:01:18.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不用谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.08,0:01:19.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}选卡莱布当首相
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:20.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.28,0:01:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而我呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:22.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.76,0:01:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.24,0:01:25.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look at these! These are spectacular!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.24,0:01:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看这些蘑菇 太壮观了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:29.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I was now the mushroom king of Chipping Norton,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:29.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在是奇平诺顿的蘑菇之王
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.40,0:01:35.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}delivering them every day to a range of farm shops and pubs in the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.40,0:01:35.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每天给该地区的 农场商店和酒吧送蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:39.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Busy, busy, busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.28,0:01:39.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好忙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.44,0:01:44.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mushrooms are what I provided for the crew's lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.44,0:01:44.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}剧组的午餐也是我的蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:46.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.44,0:01:46.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每天如此
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:49.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}For a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.48,0:01:49.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}持续了一个月
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.92,0:01:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they're all I could ever talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.92,0:01:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们是我唯一的谈资
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.48,0:01:56.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You take the bags out from where they're growing now,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.48,0:01:56.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为显然 当它们再也长不出新茬时
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.52,0:01:57.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}when they've stopped flushing. I think they do three flushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.52,0:01:57.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要把袋子移出现在的生长地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.88,0:01:59.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. - Then you take them outside
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.88,0:01:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我觉得它们会长三茬 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:04.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- and they continue to just grow outside. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.88,0:02:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后就把它们拿出去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:04.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们会继续在野外生长...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.36,0:02:06.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But you put new bags in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.36,0:02:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 继续生长 - ...同时 你会把新种植袋放进去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:07.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A pause in proceedings was coming, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.16,0:02:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但是 活动需要暂时停止了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:21.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because as I'd just explained so rivetingly to Annie,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:21.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为就像我刚刚 生动地向安妮解释的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:25.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the bags I'd originally bought were exhausted
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我最初购买的种植袋已经到达极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.28,0:02:27.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and needed to be cleared out,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.28,0:02:27.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}需要被清理出去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so I could replace them with some new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.00,0:02:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样我就能用新的种植袋来替换它们
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.68,0:02:36.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's put them down this end while we still have strength
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.68,0:02:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}趁我们还有力气 把它们放在这边
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.08,0:02:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because by the end of it, we don't wanna go walk all down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.08,0:02:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 因为到最后... - 好的 对
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:43.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. I see. - So let's put them over yonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...我们可不想走到那边去
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.12,0:02:43.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以 我们把它们放在那边 - 好的 遵命
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:45.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi, Charlie. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:45.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗨 查理 - 嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.92,0:02:46.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How are you? - I'm very well. Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.92,0:02:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.88,0:02:49.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You don't sound it. - Well, it's not great news,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.88,0:02:49.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我很好 - 听上去可不像
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:54.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I'm afraid. There's a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:52.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯...恐怕不是个好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那可真让人意外啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:02:56.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hum...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:57.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.40,0:02:57.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.04,0:03:01.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I had three quotes back for the car park.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.04,0:03:01.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我收到了三份停车场的报价
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:02.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.44,0:03:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.44,0:03:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The first one is sort of, you know, 67,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.44,0:03:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一家报价六万七千多英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:09.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- plus... What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.92,0:03:09.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么? - 外加...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.68,0:03:13.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No... Plus some provisional sums, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.68,0:03:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没完 外加一些暂定金额 用于七七八八的事项
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:15.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for this and for that, because they're not quite sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.20,0:03:15.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为他们也不太确定
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:19.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The next one is 80, plus a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.84,0:03:19.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二家八万多一点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:21.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And then-- -£80,000?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.80,0:03:21.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后... - 八万英镑!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.48,0:03:25.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then the one that actually I think is most sort of complete
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.48,0:03:25.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 我觉得报价最完整的一家
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.76,0:03:28.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because it includes the new highway entrance...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.76,0:03:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它包含了新的高速公路入口
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:32.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah? -£94,127.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:32.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 多少? - 94127英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:36.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}For a car park?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:37.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就一个停车场? - 一个停车场和新的入口
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.24,0:03:37.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}For car park and a new entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:40.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We're providing all the stone? - We've got the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.48,0:03:40.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们会从采石场提供石头? - 我们有石头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:43.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- But we're providing. There's no... - There's no cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.40,0:03:43.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这...我... - 但我们会提供...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.64,0:03:47.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And stone is the horrendous, you know, you know--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.64,0:03:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 报价不含石头费用 - 我们不需要买任何东西
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.96,0:03:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}石头是最恐怖的...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:49.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But we have the stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.00,0:03:49.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但我们有石头 - 我们有石头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.24,0:03:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got it! We've got £50,000 worth of stone in the--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.24,0:03:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有价值五万英镑的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.64,0:03:53.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Is that--? That's what it would be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.64,0:03:53.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那... - 大致就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-£97,000? £94,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.52,0:03:55.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}九万七千英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:59.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ninety? - Even I was astounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.52,0:03:57.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 九万四千 - 九万...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.56,0:03:58.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就连我都惊呆了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.84,0:04:01.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ninety! Oh come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.84,0:04:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}九万...拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.68,0:04:05.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, I thought worst-case scenario,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.68,0:04:05.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我...我以为最坏的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.28,0:04:07.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a car park, when we provide the stone,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.28,0:04:07.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们提供石头 建一个停车场
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.68,0:04:09.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-£20,000? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.68,0:04:09.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 也就两万? - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:12.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why don't we do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.96,0:04:12.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不如我们自己动手吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I mean, seriously, how hard can it be to build, I know I've said that before,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说真的 建个停车场能有多难...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.32,0:04:18.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but really, to build a car park?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.32,0:04:18.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道我以前说过这种话 但说真的 建个停车场而已
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:20.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Move soil. - Yeah, you scrape the soil off,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:20.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 新土壤 - 对 要把土刮掉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.68,0:04:26.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}put some of that plastic sheeting down to stop the weeds coming through and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.68,0:04:24.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}铺一些塑料薄膜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.56,0:04:26.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}避免杂草生长等等
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.36,0:04:28.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Is this gonna take long?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.36,0:04:28.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 要很长时间吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:31.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, this is serious. Honestly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.20,0:04:31.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}要 这老实说真的很严重
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:33.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Our stone. - Yeah. Move the stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.68,0:04:33.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:35.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And then we get a bit of gravel. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.00,0:04:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 搬运石头 - 然后 我们去弄一些砾石
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:38.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we need to hire a bulldozer, a roller.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:38.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 这样 我们需要租一台推土机
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb. Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.76,0:04:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 一台压路机 - 卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:42.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.00,0:04:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you want a cup of tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.00,0:04:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你们想喝茶吗? - 说实话 不想
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, honestly, this is really serious. Sorry. I'll be with you in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对不起 这事真的很严肃 我一会儿就来帮你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.92,0:04:48.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.92,0:04:48.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们得自己动手了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.92,0:04:51.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna have to do it ourselves. I've got to get on and do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.92,0:04:51.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我得继续搬蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.12,0:04:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you know I'm apprehensive about, you know, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.12,0:04:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就跟他们说... - 我担心...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:56.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're always apprehensive, Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.20,0:04:56.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是啊 但是... - 你总是很担心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.08,0:04:57.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But this time, this time, actually, I think--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.08,0:04:57.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 只有你 - 但这次
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:05:01.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We can do it ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.92,0:05:01.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 说实话 我觉得... - 不 但...我们可以自己动手
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:06.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}After Lisa had helped me load the bags...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.16,0:05:06.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎帮我装好种植袋后...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:10.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:10.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:13.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...we took them to our new compost bed,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.64,0:05:13.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...我们把它们带到了新的堆肥处
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because if we put them on that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.32,0:05:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为如果我们把它们放在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:20.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}there was a chance mushrooms would continue to grow out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.92,0:05:20.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蘑菇很有可能会继续生长
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shall I take them out and you can carry them over?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我把它们拿出来 你可以把它们搬过去
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:26.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Does that work? - No, we'll just do them individually.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:26.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 可以吗? - 不了 我们各做各的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:27.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okey-dokey
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:28.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那好吧 亲爱的? - 好的 认真的?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:28.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.96,0:05:31.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.96,0:05:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.00,0:05:35.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think I'm gonna take a few out at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.00,0:05:35.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我这次要拿几袋出来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:37.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause otherwise we're gonna be here all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.00,0:05:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不然 我们得整晚都耗在这里了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:42.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All day, all night.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.76,0:05:42.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}整天整晚
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do we have to dig them in a bit or just plonk them?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.52,0:05:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}需要把它们挖进去一点 还是只是直接放在那里?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.36,0:06:15.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}An email.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.36,0:06:15.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一封电子邮件
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That doesn't work with a glove on. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.52,0:06:19.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}戴着手套看不了 稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.12,0:06:21.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll take it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.12,0:06:21.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我把手套脱了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:24.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is from the mushroom testing people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.84,0:06:24.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是蘑菇测试人员发来的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:26.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh! Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.32,0:06:26.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:28.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.44,0:06:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:34.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Before dehydrated mushrooms can be sold", your lion's mane, basically,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.84,0:06:32.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“在售卖脱水蘑菇前”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.28,0:06:34.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 也就是你的猴头菇... - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:38.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"a bacterial and water activity test must be done
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.32,0:06:38.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“...必须通过英国认可的科学机构 UKAS
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.24,0:06:41.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"through the UKAS UK Accredited Science
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.24,0:06:41.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“进行的细菌和水活性测试
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:44.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"to determine the water and bacteria..."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.72,0:06:44.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“这是为了确定水和细菌...”
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:48.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Knowing Lisa's attitude to paperwork,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.76,0:06:48.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我很清楚丽莎对文书工作的态度
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.96,0:06:52.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I left her to carry on unloading the mushrooms
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.96,0:06:52.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我让她继续卸蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and set about filling in the necessary forms myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.12,0:06:54.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而我则开始亲自填写必要的表格
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:57.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}食用前需要进行哪些进一步的加工?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.08,0:06:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}无
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:07:00.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Proposed target shelf life including date of production?"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.00,0:07:00.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“含生产日期当日的 拟定目标保质期?”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One month.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.68,0:07:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一个月
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.24,0:07:04.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"What's the CCP of this product?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.24,0:07:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“此产品的CCP是什么?”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:10.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}CCP.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:10.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}CCP
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"What is the CCP?" It says it's the Chinese Communist Party.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.08,0:07:11.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“CCP 是什么?”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.72,0:07:14.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}网上说是“中国共产党”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:15.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.76,0:07:15.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.48,0:07:21.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"What is the controlling factor for Clostridium botulinum?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.48,0:07:21.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“肉毒杆菌的控制因素是什么?”
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:23.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't fucking know!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:23.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我他妈不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:29.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Having filled out the forms to the best of my abilities
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.48,0:07:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我尽我所能填好了表格
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:31.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and bagged up a sample...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.72,0:07:31.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}并把样本装袋后...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:36.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:36.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:40.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...I sent everything off to the mushroom police.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.40,0:07:40.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...我把所有资料都寄给了蘑菇警察
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:42.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Brilliant!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.64,0:07:42.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:48.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then, after Lisa and I had disinfected the mushroom bunker
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.20,0:07:48.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后丽莎和我给蘑菇堡消毒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:51.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and restocked it with new bags...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.08,0:07:51.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}并重新放上新的种植袋
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:53.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And are we gonna keep going with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.80,0:07:54.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们还要继续种蘑菇吗? - 当然要了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.36,0:07:54.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bloody right we are!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.40,0:08:00.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...we waited for a day when the shop was closed anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.40,0:08:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们等了一天 当商店关门时
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:04.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}assembled the Diddly Squat Avengers...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.36,0:08:04.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们召集了 迪丽斯库阿特农场的复仇者们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:10.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...and set about building our cut-price car park.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:10.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开始建造我们自己的廉价停车场
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:14.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. Gather round, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.84,0:08:14.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 大家都过来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.08,0:08:15.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've mowed it already. Have you seen?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.08,0:08:15.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们已经割完草了 看见了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.80,0:08:16.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, I've seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.80,0:08:16.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 看见了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.88,0:08:19.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is there a measurement for how much space a car--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.88,0:08:19.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}知道一辆车
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:22.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, there is. We need about 2.4 by 4.8.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.12,0:08:22.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 要占多少空间吗? - 知道 需要2.4乘4.8的空间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.36,0:08:24.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- 4.8 m? Longways.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.36,0:08:24.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 4.8米 - 纵向
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you've got 74 parks, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.56,0:08:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以分为74个 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:28.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The disabled ones are a different size.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:28.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}残障人士的停车位大小不同
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're 6 m by 3 m.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}需要6乘3米的空间
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:33.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And if any more disabled come, they can come out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果要安排更多残障人士停车位 可以安排到这里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:35.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- This is tarmac. - OK, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:35.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这是柏油路 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.48,0:08:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's nice for their wheelchairs. We've got another entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.48,0:08:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这很适合坐轮椅的人 - 我刚发现我们有另一个入口
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.72,0:08:40.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got another entrance and you've got a push-bike rack.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.72,0:08:40.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你有另一个入口和自行车架
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:42.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cycle parking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:42.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}自行车停车场?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:44.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well. Motorcycle, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.20,0:08:44.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}摩托车 任何...摩托车的数量...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why don't we just put a sign up saying "No Cyclists"?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.16,0:08:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们为什么不挂个牌子 写上“骑手禁止入内”?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.12,0:08:49.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I'm with that. Good idea. I'm with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.12,0:08:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我同意 - 我同意
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.52,0:08:49.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好主意 - 我们都...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:52.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Quick question, though. How long is this gonna take?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.00,0:08:52.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一个简单的问题 这需要多久?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause, I mean, we're in July now. Just in terms of my timescale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.76,0:08:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为现在是七月了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:56.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- How long is it gonna take? - A month.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:56.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}按我的时间表来算 需要多长时间?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.52,0:08:59.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It won't take a month!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.52,0:08:57.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一个月
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:08:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 要不了一个月! - 一个月?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.32,0:09:00.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}20 days. A build is 20 days, ain't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.32,0:09:00.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 二十天建造... - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:03.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Five days a week. We're not coming Saturday 'cause it's open.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.76,0:09:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}二十天 不是吗?一周五天 我们周六不来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.36,0:09:05.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've gotta go to church on a Sunday!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.36,0:09:04.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 因为这里开放 - 确实
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:06.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我周日要去教堂
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:10.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna have this done in two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:10.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们得在两天内建好 - 不行 建不好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.08,0:09:10.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:12.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We are! - No! Now stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.00,0:09:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 可以的 - 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.08,0:09:13.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 别说了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I can't see what's the-- No! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:15.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我不明白为什么不... - 不 闭嘴!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:16.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Chief, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.64,0:09:16.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}老大 冷静
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's up with him? Two days!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他怎么回事?两天 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.48,0:09:24.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To meet my two-day deadline,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.48,0:09:24.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为了满足我两天的期限
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:28.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we needed, first of all, to remove all the topsoil.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.64,0:09:28.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们首先要移除所有表土
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.20,0:09:30.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, Kaleb got to work with his digger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.20,0:09:30.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 卡莱布得操控挖掘机
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.32,0:09:32.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go back a bit. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.32,0:09:32.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}往后退一点 继续
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:37.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I put myself in charge of soil removal with the dumper.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.88,0:09:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我则负责用自卸车清理土壤
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:40.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, now stop. Let go of the right and use your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.64,0:09:40.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 现在停车 松开右边 用你的左边
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:45.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And Lisa got a crash course on how to operate the 14-tonner.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.16,0:09:45.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎在上速成班 学习如何操作这辆14吨级车
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:47.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Up. That's backwards to you. Now down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.48,0:09:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那会让你倒车 现在放下铲斗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Actually, that's spot-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.76,0:09:52.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 正确
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:53.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yep. Thanks, Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.32,0:09:53.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 谢谢你 艾伦
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:59.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Certainly she preferred Alan as an instructor to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.76,0:09:59.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当然 比起我 她更喜欢让艾伦教
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:02.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You might want to move your digger.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.88,0:10:02.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可能应该移动一下你的挖掘机
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.32,0:10:04.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.32,0:10:04.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:05.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Lisa? - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:05.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 丽莎? - 怎么?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:08.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you move your whole digger 3 ft forwards it'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你能把挖掘机 向前移动一米就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.64,0:10:11.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Lisa? - Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.64,0:10:11.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 丽莎? - 听见了!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.36,0:10:14.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, you haven't really got a load there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.36,0:10:14.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不对 你没有把土装进去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:18.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you just gonna stand there and criticise the entire afternoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.12,0:10:18.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你打算整个下午 就站在那儿批评我吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.52,0:10:21.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You and your hi-vis, would you "feck" off?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.52,0:10:21.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你和你的安全背心 能滚开吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:28.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come the morning of the second and final day,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.88,0:10:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天 也是最后一天的早晨
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:32.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we had removed nearly most of the topsoil
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.76,0:10:32.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们差不多把大部分表土都铲走了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.76,0:10:36.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and had begun to lay the plastic sheeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.76,0:10:36.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后开始铺塑料薄膜
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.52,0:10:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I felt confident we'd get everything done
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.52,0:10:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我有信心我们能在第二天早上
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.40,0:10:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}by the time the shop opened again the following morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.40,0:10:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}商店重新营业前 完成所有工作
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.76,0:10:47.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ I'm a digger driver ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.76,0:10:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我是挖掘机司机
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:53.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Alan?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.52,0:10:53.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}艾伦
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.72,0:10:56.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- When do you start needing the stone? - Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.72,0:10:56.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你什么时候开始需要石头? - 现在就要
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.32,0:10:58.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Now? ASAP.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.32,0:10:58.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就现在? - 尽快
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:11:00.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause if it turns wet...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.44,0:11:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}免得塑料薄膜湿了...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:03.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Putting Lisa on the dump truck,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.80,0:11:03.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我让丽莎去开自卸车
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb and I hurried over to the Diddly Squat quarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.68,0:11:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而卡莱布和我则匆忙赶往 迪丽斯库阿特农场采石场
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So just to remind everybody, the stone that Kaleb's loading up now
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只是提醒大家
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.88,0:11:14.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布现在在装载的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.72,0:11:17.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is what we dug to build the farm track
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.72,0:11:17.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是我们本来挖出来修建农场道路用的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:20.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that the council then said we couldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:20.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但后来议会不让我们修
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:23.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The upside of that is we got a lot of stone left over
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.32,0:11:23.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好处是 我们还剩了很多石头
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.36,0:11:26.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which we can use to make the car park, which they also said we couldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.36,0:11:26.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可以拿来修建停车场 而当时议会也不让我们建
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.84,0:11:30.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Some time today would be good, Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.84,0:11:30.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今天之内装满就行 卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.64,0:11:33.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Am I nearly full?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.64,0:11:33.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}差不多装满了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.44,0:11:35.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, you impatient fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.44,0:11:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 你太没耐心了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:40.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey, Kaleb? I've had an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.12,0:11:40.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿 卡莱布 我有个主意
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.00,0:11:41.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.00,0:11:41.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么主意?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We need someone to drive your tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.96,0:11:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要找人开你的拖拉机
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:45.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It would be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.52,0:11:48.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那样更简单 不是吗? 我就留在挖掘机上 负责装载
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.72,0:11:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll stay on the digger then and just load.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.32,0:11:50.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, guess who's just pulled up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.32,0:11:50.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猜猜谁开车来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.68,0:11:55.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, Lisa and Alan, incoming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.68,0:11:55.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 丽莎和艾伦注意 石头到了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.24,0:11:58.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Incoming, yeah, mate. Keep going. Keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.24,0:11:58.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}继续朝我这边开 继续 继续开!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:01.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}OK. Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.08,0:12:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 干得好
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:04.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go in top gear and go get me another one quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.68,0:12:04.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}红毛 你得快速再给我运一车过来
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.64,0:12:08.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nice surprise on who's driving the next tractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.64,0:12:08.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下一位拖拉机司机会让你大吃一惊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.08,0:12:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Gerald!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.08,0:12:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嘿 杰拉德!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:24.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the full Diddly Squat army out today. I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.36,0:12:24.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今天迪丽斯库阿特农场 全军出动 我喜闻乐见
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Gerald, that was the best bit of reversing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.20,0:12:35.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}杰拉德 这是我在这座农场里见过的 最厉害的倒车技术 伙计
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.00,0:12:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've ever seen on this farm, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.76,0:12:42.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.76,0:12:42.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 这个 它们都知道该停在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.12,0:12:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们希望被停在主干道上 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.20,0:12:50.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没关系 你就是这么做的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.04,0:12:58.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello. Copy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.04,0:12:58.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}艾伦 收到了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.56,0:13:00.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I got you, Gerald. What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.56,0:13:00.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}听到了 杰拉德 怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:05.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, they were just asking me how long is it gonna take to move all this rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.88,0:13:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只是问一下多久才能...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.04,0:13:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}搬走这个 所有这些碎石 还有...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.44,0:13:11.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它停在通往公路的道路上了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All week the way it's going, but it'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.64,0:13:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}整周都是这样 但会没事的 老大
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:16.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once we get rolling, it'll be all right. You'll be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.32,0:13:16.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一旦我们开始行动 我打赌你会大吃一惊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.68,0:13:18.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}自卸车驶入
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:22.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It turns out that Alan speaks fluent Gerald.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.52,0:13:22.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}原来艾伦会说一口流利的杰拉德语
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:26.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The two of them can have proper conversations.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们俩能正常交谈
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.56,0:13:27.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把它放在大车库旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.96,0:13:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they are bloody good mates.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.96,0:13:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们俩是好伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:34.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And Alan, while Gerald was ill, was really, really a good mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:34.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在杰拉德生病期间 艾伦真的是个很好的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:38.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They've known each other for donkey's years, those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.88,0:13:38.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们两人认识彼此很多年了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:42.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Up at the car park,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.36,0:13:46.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在停车场 丽莎正在使用她很喜欢的机器
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.84,0:13:46.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa was now using a machine which she liked very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.08,0:13:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.08,0:13:51.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 太棒了!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.40,0:13:53.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, fabulous. Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.96,0:13:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}慢点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.56,0:14:00.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Slow down? Sorry. OK... I don't wanna slow down.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.56,0:13:59.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}慢点 抱歉 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.92,0:14:00.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不想慢下来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:13.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}However, as much as Lisa was enjoying life on her cab seat,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.80,0:14:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然而 尽管丽莎非常享受 坐在她的车上的生活
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.68,0:14:16.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I must say, I wasn't on mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.68,0:14:16.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我必须说我可不太享受我的车上生活
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.12,0:14:22.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it wasn't just me either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.12,0:14:22.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且也不只我如此
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.28,0:14:24.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, bloody hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.28,0:14:24.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.52,0:14:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not sure how much longer Gerald will be able to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.52,0:14:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不确定杰拉德还能坚持多久
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.04,0:14:29.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's quite bouncy and tiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.04,0:14:29.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这路很颠簸 开车挺累的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:32.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you all right? 'Cause that bouncing--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.40,0:14:32.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你还好吗?因为路很颠簸?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:34.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, I can't do no more today like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.12,0:14:34.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不好 我今天不能再接着干了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:36.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's last bit, innit? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.20,0:14:36.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 因为一直颠簸 对吧? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:39.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We will manage. I don't know how, but we will manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.56,0:14:39.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们能处理 我还没想到办法 但我们能处理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:47.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With Gerald gone, we gave it our best shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}杰拉德走了 我们得竭尽全力
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But we were now down to one trailer, which, if I'm honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.28,0:14:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们现在只剩一台拖拉机了 实话实说
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:54.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was a bit too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.68,0:14:54.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它有点太小了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:15:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, soon I realised we were going to miss my deadline.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.52,0:15:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我很快就发现 我们会错过我定的最后期限
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.28,0:15:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb, realistically, we're not gonna get this done today, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.28,0:15:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布 现实地说 我们今天做不完 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:11.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, you won't get all of it done, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.72,0:15:11.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 做不完的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:14.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.12,0:15:14.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.76,0:15:19.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, we can't transport this stone when the shop is open,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.76,0:15:19.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等商店开门了 我们就没法运输石头
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:23.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause we'd run over, I don't know, six children a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.96,0:15:23.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我们路上一天 会碰到六个孩子吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:28.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that would go on the news, I know it would.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:28.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这会上新闻的 我知道会那样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.72,0:15:32.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As night began to fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.72,0:15:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}随着夜幕降临 我们的无人机 显示我们很勇敢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.60,0:15:35.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}our drone revealed that we'd been valiant,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.36,0:15:38.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but that Alan may have had a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.36,0:15:38.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但艾伦可能言之有理
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.40,0:15:42.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're gonna be here next week now, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.40,0:15:42.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这下我们得下周才能继续了 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.44,0:15:44.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.28,0:15:58.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As the shop wouldn't be closed again for another five days,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.28,0:15:58.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}鉴于商店五天后才会再次休业
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:16:02.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I used the time to take care of some pressing matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:16:02.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我利用这段时间 去解决一些紧迫的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:04.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Job one: the pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.64,0:16:04.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一项工作 猪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:09.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The sows were due to give birth in a couple of weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.08,0:16:09.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几周后 母猪就要生产了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.76,0:16:13.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And, worried that the previous piglet deaths
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.76,0:16:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我很担心之前
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:16.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}had been caused by them being squashed...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.76,0:16:16.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪崽被坐死的事会再次发生...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.40,0:16:18.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Did you get laid on?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.40,0:16:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你被压到了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.32,0:16:21.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow! She's just sat on another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.32,0:16:21.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它刚刚又坐到了另一只身上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:26.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...I called a meeting with the chaps who'd designed the pigloos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.32,0:16:26.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我跟设计猪窝的人开了一次会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.08,0:16:31.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we lost 14 pigs
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.08,0:16:31.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们本来有34只猪崽
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.92,0:16:33.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}out of 34.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.92,0:16:33.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}死了14只
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:35.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}OK. So a high mortality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.92,0:16:35.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 所以死亡率很高
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.48,0:16:38.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I had a thought
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.48,0:16:38.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:41.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that the piglets tend to lie like this along the side of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:41.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪崽往往会这样躺在它的旁边
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:43.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But when Unit,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:45.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但当猪小队... 它叫这个名字是有原因的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:46.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- who is called Unit for a reason...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.44,0:16:49.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...lies down, she's that shape. That's her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.44,0:16:49.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它躺下时 是那样的 那是它的后背
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.52,0:16:50.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. See what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.52,0:16:50.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.60,0:16:55.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they were being squidged.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.60,0:16:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们明白我的意思吗? 它们是被压死的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You need to move her away from the wall of the hut,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.24,0:16:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我更担心的是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.68,0:17:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- move her away... - Exactly. So I had a thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.68,0:16:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你得把它从小屋的墙边移开 把它移走
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.68,0:17:02.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 所以我有个想法
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:05.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What if there was a bit like that
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.04,0:17:05.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果猪窝是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.36,0:17:09.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so that the piglets could lie in here and the mum could lie there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.36,0:17:09.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样猪崽就可以躺在这里 而猪妈妈躺在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:12.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- If she squidges against the side... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.20,0:17:11.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果它贴着那边压下去...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.16,0:17:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.20,0:17:14.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They won't be squidged.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.20,0:17:14.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...它们有一些...它们就不会被压死
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:15.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.92,0:17:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.92,0:17:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you think that would be possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.92,0:17:17.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们觉得这有可行性吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:20.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what you'd have is you'd have, if this is a side profile of your hut,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.52,0:17:20.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你会有... 如果这是你的小屋的侧面轮廓
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.80,0:17:23.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you'd have a ring that sat like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.80,0:17:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你会有一个像这样的环
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then your leg that would come down like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后腿可以像这样向下伸展
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:28.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Like a rail.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:28.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就像铁轨一样 - 诸如此类
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.72,0:17:30.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Or something. - A halo, effectively.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.72,0:17:30.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 实际上像一个光圈 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.72,0:17:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's retrofittable to what you've already got.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.72,0:17:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它可以安装到你已有的装备上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.72,0:17:35.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That would be fantastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.72,0:17:35.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:38.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With the pig men despatched,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.44,0:17:38.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}跟养猪人开完会后
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I then turned my mind to the next farming the unfarmed scheme:
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.28,0:17:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我又想到了另一个开发非耕地的计划
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.24,0:17:45.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bambi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.24,0:17:45.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小鹿斑比
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.72,0:17:50.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In recent years, Diddly Squat had been overrun with deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.72,0:17:50.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些年来 迪丽斯库阿特 鹿群泛滥成灾
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:54.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And, as they cause enormous damage to young trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.80,0:17:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}由于它们对小树造成了巨大的破坏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:57.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we, along with other landowners and farmers,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:57.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}政府要求我们 和其他土地所有者及农民
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:18:01.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}had been asked by the government to reduce their numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:18:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一起减少它们的数量
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.44,0:18:06.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I therefore contacted Hugh, a local hunter,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.44,0:18:06.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因此 我联系了当地猎人休
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.24,0:18:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}who also happens to be chairman of the Deer Society.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.24,0:18:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他刚好是鹿协会的主席
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:16.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It falls on us to manage the deer numbers in this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.72,0:18:16.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们要负责解决本国的鹿群数量问题
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:19.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And part of our role is training people to manage deer properly
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.00,0:18:19.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的部分职责是培训人们
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.44,0:18:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- to the highest standards of welfare. And the fact is,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.44,0:18:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}以最高的福利标准来妥善管理鹿群
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:26.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the deer population is now getting too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:26.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}事实上 鹿群数量 现在已经变得过于庞大
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.80,0:18:28.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, which it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.80,0:18:28.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 确实如此 - 的确如此
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.16,0:18:31.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which it is. And the people are planting trees like these...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.16,0:18:31.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且人们正在种这种树木
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:33.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. - And then the deer eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.40,0:18:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 然后鹿会吃掉那些树
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.76,0:18:37.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I think that the story that needs to be told
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.76,0:18:37.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我认为关键在于
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:41.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is that if you are going to shoot a deer,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.96,0:18:41.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你要猎杀一头鹿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:45.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it's for all the right reasons
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:45.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}必须有正当理由
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.48,0:18:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}coupled with the fact that you're only gonna do it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.48,0:18:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}并且
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.20,0:18:51.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if you are completely confident
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.20,0:18:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只有在你完全有信心 能以最人道的方式
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.08,0:18:56.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that you can do it in as humane a manner as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.08,0:18:56.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猎杀它们时才能付诸行动
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.44,0:18:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}查德灵顿
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:03.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Up at the farm, Hugh showed me how to assemble a hunting rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.40,0:19:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在农场 休教了我如何组装猎枪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is gonna be the most manly thing ever shown on television.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这将是电视上展示的最爷们的一幕
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.52,0:19:20.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With the flat-pack gun assembled,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.52,0:19:22.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}组装好枪后 我们出发去进行一些射击练习
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.44,0:19:23.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we set off for some target practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:26.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So how far away is the target?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.20,0:19:26.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}靶子有多远?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.52,0:19:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Um, that's probably gonna be about a hundred yards?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.52,0:19:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大约一百码 九十、一百码
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.64,0:19:31.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's more. - 90 yards?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:34.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, it's more than that. Say it's more than that for the cameras.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:34.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不对吧 比那距离远 在镜头前说比那距离远
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:37.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sorry. - 300 yards, I'd say that target?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:37.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 抱歉 - 那个靶子三百码?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}At least. And a very strong crosswind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}至少 还有非常强劲的横风
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.08,0:19:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. 300 yards with a strong crosswind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.08,0:19:42.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 三百码还有强劲的横风 - 你得好好打才能打中
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.28,0:19:42.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're gonna do well to hit that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.32,0:19:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can barely hold my finger up in this gale.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.32,0:19:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这么大的风 我手指都举不起来
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:49.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As we prepared for my practice,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.92,0:19:49.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在我们为我的练习做准备时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.16,0:19:53.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hugh explained some more about the need for good deer management.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.16,0:19:53.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}休进一步解释了 妥善管理鹿群的必要性
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:57.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where there are overpopulations of deer,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.56,0:19:57.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在鹿群数量过多的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:59.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we have seen body weights of deer
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:59.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们会看到鹿的体重
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:02.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}way below the average of what they should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:02.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}远远低于它们应该达到的平均水平
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.16,0:20:05.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And when they are managed properly, the body weights come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.16,0:20:04.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当其数量得到妥善管理时
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.28,0:20:05.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你就会看到其体重上升
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.96,0:20:07.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're thin? - The weight is below what it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.96,0:20:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}鹿的实际体重?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.44,0:20:12.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, you know, it does create a welfare issue
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.44,0:20:09.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其体重低于它应有的水平
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.80,0:20:12.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}显然所以当一个种群过于密集时
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.72,0:20:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}when you have too dense a population, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.72,0:20:15.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}的确会出现民生问题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:18.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's a weird world in which we now live,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.48,0:20:18.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们现在居住的世界真奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because there's an overpopulation of deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:20.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为鹿也存在数量过多的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.92,0:20:22.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.92,0:20:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.08,0:20:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The only realistic way you can reduce deer numbers is with a rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.08,0:20:24.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}唯一现实的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.56,0:20:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}减少鹿群数量的方式就是用步枪猎杀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.64,0:20:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And if you're going to kill a deer, you may as well eat it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.64,0:20:30.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你要猎杀一头鹿 你可能也会吃鹿肉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:33.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I mean, it's daft not to eat it. - Definitely, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.64,0:20:33.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不吃鹿肉才蠢呢 - 当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:36.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Or give it to schools and hospitals as you've been suggesting for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.80,0:20:35.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}或者就像你长期以来一直建议的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.92,0:20:37.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 把它交给学校或医院 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.68,0:20:38.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.68,0:20:38.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.32,0:20:43.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if I were to kill a deer on television, they'd all go berserk,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.32,0:20:43.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我要在电视上播出猎杀鹿的画面
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.04,0:20:44.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}even though it's good reason, good reason, good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.04,0:20:44.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那人们会愤怒至极
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:49.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- There's no reason to not do it. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.20,0:20:47.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}即便你有很好的理由
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.20,0:20:49.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不行 没有理由不这么做 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.32,0:20:52.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The challenge is educating people
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.32,0:20:55.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}难点在于教育人们为什么需要这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.48,0:20:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as to why all this needs to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.56,0:20:57.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it's good for the deer. It's good for the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.56,0:20:57.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这有益于鹿群
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:20:59.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. - And it's free food.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.32,0:20:59.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 有益于树木 - 有益于两者 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Definitely, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 而且这是免费的食物 - 当然了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, I think if there was a more effective way
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.20,0:21:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得如果有更有效的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.96,0:21:08.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to manage our deer population,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.96,0:21:08.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}来管理鹿群
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.48,0:21:09.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we'd be doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.48,0:21:09.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们会照做的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.04,0:21:13.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We then got down to business.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.04,0:21:13.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们就开始干正事了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.44,0:21:15.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. And in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.44,0:21:14.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.56,0:21:15.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}上膛
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.56,0:21:21.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With me aiming for the red squares on the paper targets.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.56,0:21:21.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我瞄准了纸质标靶上的红色方块
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:24.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. Good to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.68,0:21:24.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 可以开枪了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:30.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.48,0:21:30.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:33.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm assuming you were going for the one on the left and not in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.40,0:21:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我猜你在瞄准左边那个 没瞄准中间的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.32,0:21:36.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a bullseye!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.32,0:21:36.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}正中靶心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to prove it wasn't a fluke, you need to do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.80,0:21:42.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为了证明那一枪并非蒙中的...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.56,0:21:43.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好 - 你需要再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.96,0:21:47.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And as it happened, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.96,0:21:47.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}事实上 我确实又做到了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:50.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}An even better shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.52,0:21:50.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这一枪甚至更准
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where is it? - You've got even closer to the bullseye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}射中哪儿了?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.96,0:21:54.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你甚至离靶心更近了 好样的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.48,0:21:59.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What am I shooting now? The roe's heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.48,0:21:59.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在射什么?牝鹿的心脏?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.52,0:22:02.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. The orange disc,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.52,0:22:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 那个橙色圆盘
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.40,0:22:05.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that is where you would be aiming
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.40,0:22:06.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们明天出去狩猎时 你就得瞄准那里
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.56,0:22:07.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}when we go out tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.04,0:22:10.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.04,0:22:10.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.00,0:22:11.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you wanna shoot a muntjac now?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.00,0:22:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你现在想射那头鹿吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.96,0:22:20.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It pains me to say it, but that's five out of five!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.96,0:22:20.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}虽然不情愿 但我得说你五发五中
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I've found something I'm good at! That was very good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我发现了我擅长的事了 - 非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.44,0:22:32.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The next morning, at dawn,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.44,0:22:32.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天黎明时分
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.60,0:22:36.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Robert De Niro and I set off in search of deer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.60,0:22:36.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我和猎鹿人休出发去找鹿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.00,0:22:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.72,0:22:42.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's quite a problem is wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.72,0:22:42.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}问题是有风
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.12,0:22:43.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There isn't any.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.12,0:22:43.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有风
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.24,0:22:46.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.24,0:22:46.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.40,0:22:49.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're kidding. You bought that from a shop, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.40,0:22:47.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你开玩笑吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.48,0:22:49.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你是从商店里买的吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.00,0:22:52.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The man said it tells you where the wind is coming from.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.00,0:22:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.04,0:22:52.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那人说这会告诉你风向
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.96,0:22:56.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what we'll do, just quietly look round this corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.96,0:22:56.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们会悄悄移动到这个角落
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.48,0:22:58.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}come out onto the edge again to go, just creep down...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.48,0:22:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后走到边缘 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.08,0:22:59.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}悄悄靠近边缘 爬上高位平台
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.96,0:23:01.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}过度乐观的狩猎胡言乱语
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.16,0:23:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比穿过树林安静
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.56,0:23:07.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}While we were scanning the perimeter,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.56,0:23:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当我们扫视四周时
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.04,0:23:10.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}an opportunity suddenly presented itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.04,0:23:10.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一个机会突然出现了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.80,0:23:13.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There is a buck.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.80,0:23:13.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有一头公鹿
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.48,0:23:16.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.48,0:23:16.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.32,0:23:21.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.24,0:23:27.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you're going to shoot...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.24,0:23:27.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你要开枪...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.60,0:23:29.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, he's looking straight at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.60,0:23:29.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行 它在盯着我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.64,0:23:32.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There. You can shoot him now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.64,0:23:33.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 行了 你现在可以开枪了 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.84,0:23:33.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.76,0:23:38.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, that's a really easy shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.76,0:23:38.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 这枪很简单
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.52,0:23:40.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.52,0:23:40.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.84,0:23:44.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.84,0:23:44.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 准备了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.32,0:23:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. He's good now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.32,0:23:48.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 它现在好了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.32,0:23:50.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Whenever you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.32,0:23:50.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你准备好了就开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.48,0:23:53.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I've got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.48,0:23:53.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好 我瞄准它了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.92,0:23:55.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.92,0:23:55.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.00,0:23:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's gone in the long grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.00,0:23:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它要去高草地
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.80,0:24:03.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's him catching us. He's busted us.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.80,0:24:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行 那是它发现我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.76,0:24:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它看到我们了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.72,0:24:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mr De Niro and the world's most hesitant shooter
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.72,0:24:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猎鹿人先生和世界上最犹豫的射手
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.04,0:24:11.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}continued onwards
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.04,0:24:14.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}继续前进 直到我们抵达合适的有利位置
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.76,0:24:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}until we reached a suitable vantage point.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.52,0:24:22.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If we're up there: out of sight, out of their sense of smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.52,0:24:22.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们去上面那里 它就看不到也闻不到我们
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.08,0:24:23.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh really?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.08,0:24:23.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.16,0:24:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then, after a surprisingly short wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.16,0:24:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 在短暂的等待之后...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.96,0:24:50.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.96,0:24:50.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我发现它了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.36,0:24:56.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.36,0:24:56.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开枪
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.80,0:24:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's a perfect one to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.80,0:25:00.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它就是天选之鹿 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.56,0:25:00.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.92,0:25:17.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyone for a hotdog? Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.92,0:25:15.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有人想吃热狗吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.96,0:25:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当然了 嘿!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.28,0:25:21.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I want you to try them and I want you to tell me what you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.28,0:25:21.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们尝尝吧 告诉我你们觉得怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.96,0:25:25.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is this not a vegan sausage then? No, it's not vegan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.96,0:25:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这不是素食香肠吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.52,0:25:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不 不是素食的 - 太好吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.32,0:25:29.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You like that? The meat's good?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.32,0:25:28.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你喜欢吗? - 非常喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.12,0:25:29.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这肉好吃吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.32,0:25:32.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What you're eating is Bambi.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.32,0:25:32.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们正在吃的是小鹿斑比
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.68,0:25:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.44,0:25:35.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}小鹿斑比!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.28,0:25:36.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Venison. - Venison?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.28,0:25:36.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 鹿肉 - 一头鹿?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.20,0:25:39.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Venison. Unbelievably good meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.20,0:25:39.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}鹿肉 好吃得难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.96,0:25:40.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's very good. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.96,0:25:40.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.92,0:25:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You're American, are you? - I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.92,0:25:43.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你想...对 你是美国人吗? - 是的 我是洛杉矶来的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.48,0:25:45.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You gonna have another?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.48,0:25:45.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你要再来一个吗? - 还不错
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.56,0:25:47.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Number two!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.56,0:25:48.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 第二个 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.52,0:25:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.56,0:25:50.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, we'd saved some trees
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.56,0:25:50.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们拯救了一些树木
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.40,0:25:54.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and as a result, provided a healthy and inexpensive lunch
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.40,0:25:55.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}并给人们提供了健康且便宜的午餐
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.28,0:25:55.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for the crowds,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.24,0:25:57.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which made me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.24,0:25:57.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这让我非常开心
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.36,0:26:02.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But not as happy as I was the next day,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.36,0:26:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但第二天当商店再次关门 我们可以继续修建停车场时...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.44,0:26:04.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}when the shop closed again
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.44,0:26:04.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪丽斯库阿特农场商店
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.12,0:26:07.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and we could resume work on the car park.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.12,0:26:07.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...我就更开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.00,0:26:11.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've gotta put the small bucket on there for the trenching, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.00,0:26:11.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你得加上挖掘机的铲斗 来挖沟 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.72,0:26:14.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lisa made a beeline for the roller.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.72,0:26:14.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丽莎径直走向了压路机
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.44,0:26:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh yeah, I'm good. I'm excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.44,0:26:17.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 真不错
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.28,0:26:18.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.32,0:26:23.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And Alan gave me the job of digging a drainage ditch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.32,0:26:23.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而艾伦让我去挖排水沟
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.88,0:26:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, I've got to get my tracks
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.88,0:26:29.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 我得让履带越过这条小沟
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.04,0:26:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to straddle this little ditch here,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.84,0:26:32.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so that I can dig a trench down it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.84,0:26:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样我就能沿着它挖沟了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.84,0:26:35.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now I've gotta turn sideways. How do--
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.84,0:26:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在我得把它横过来 怎么...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.04,0:26:41.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That one's jammed. Why is that one-- Oh no, that's...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.04,0:26:40.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那个卡住了 为什么那个...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.88,0:26:41.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是吧 那...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.44,0:26:47.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}After a lot of faff...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.44,0:26:47.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在一顿瞎忙之后
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.40,0:26:51.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh. I made... I need more revs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.40,0:26:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我...我需要加油门
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.56,0:26:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I finally got myself into a ditch-digging position.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.56,0:26:55.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我终于摆正了位置 能挖沟了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.36,0:26:59.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.36,0:26:59.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.28,0:27:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, leave me alone! Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.28,0:27:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别烦我!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.80,0:27:08.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.80,0:27:08.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}喂?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.00,0:27:12.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.00,0:27:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.80,0:27:15.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.80,0:27:15.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.96,0:27:20.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.96,0:27:20.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.16,0:27:26.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.16,0:27:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.92,0:27:31.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yo, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.92,0:27:31.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 哟 朋友 - 哟
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.88,0:27:35.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yo. Er, right. Do you want the bad news or the bad news?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.88,0:27:35.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 你想听坏消息 还是坏消息?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.84,0:27:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er... the bad news?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.84,0:27:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}坏消息?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.40,0:27:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The cider's exploding.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.40,0:27:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}苹果酒爆炸了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.96,0:27:43.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.96,0:27:43.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.28,0:27:47.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Immediately, Kaleb and I headed off to see if Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.28,0:27:47.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布和我立刻出发
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.08,0:27:49.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}our lager brewer,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.08,0:27:51.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去看酿酒商里克 是否知道出了什么问题
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.56,0:27:51.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}knew what had gone wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.44,0:27:54.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.44,0:27:54.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.56,0:27:57.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you have any idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.56,0:27:57.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.76,0:27:59.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, first of all, how many cases are affected?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.76,0:27:59.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}首先 受影响的有多少?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.96,0:28:02.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Um... - How many bottles are we talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.96,0:28:02.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有多少瓶受影响了?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.76,0:28:03.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thousands.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.76,0:28:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几千
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.64,0:28:06.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thousands of bottles.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.64,0:28:06.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}几千瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.56,0:28:09.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sh...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.56,0:28:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.76,0:28:11.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, it's serious. It's properly serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.76,0:28:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这很严重 非常严重
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.40,0:28:13.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause someone's been injured, I gather?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.40,0:28:13.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为据我所知 有人受伤了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.20,0:28:14.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Derbyshire, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.20,0:28:14.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}德比郡 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.24,0:28:16.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Somewhere in Derbyshire, someone's got a cut finger.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.24,0:28:16.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是在德比郡的某个地方 有人割伤了手指
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.48,0:28:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It could be that the caps aren't on sufficiently well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.48,0:28:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可能是瓶盖没盖好
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.96,0:28:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It could be that there's some microorganism in there
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.96,0:28:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也可能是因为里面有微生物
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.56,0:28:24.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that's eating the sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.56,0:28:25.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 在消耗糖分 - 所以
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.88,0:28:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So there might be
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.88,0:28:29.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}fermentation still happening in the bottles
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.88,0:28:29.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}即使已经上市 瓶子里面的酒
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.72,0:28:31.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- even though they've gone on sale? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.72,0:28:31.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可能还在发酵
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.60,0:28:35.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's highly likely. That's probably the most likely cause of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.60,0:28:33.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 很有可能
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.04,0:28:36.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是这起事故最有可能的原因
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.00,0:28:39.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Have you got one here? - I can find one in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.00,0:28:38.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你这里有吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.12,0:28:39.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我马上就能找到一瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.16,0:28:42.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Turn it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.16,0:28:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}开水吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.16,0:28:44.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We then experimented by opening a bottle
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.16,0:28:44.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 我们开瓶做实验
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.56,0:28:48.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so we could work out what warning to give to our customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.56,0:28:48.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样我们就能知道 需要给顾客什么警告
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.92,0:28:50.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pop it in the bucket, Kaleb. Get it in the bucket.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.92,0:28:50.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在桶里开瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.24,0:28:55.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You really do have to be this careful? I would. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.24,0:28:52.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 小伙子 把它放进桶里 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.16,0:28:55.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真的有必要这么小心吗? - 让我开的话我会小心
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.60,0:29:00.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's fuck all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.60,0:29:00.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他妈的没事
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.40,0:29:04.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So that's now safe when the top-- That's safe, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.40,0:29:04.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以这是安全的 因为顶部... - 这样是安全的
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.48,0:29:10.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}At the bottom of the bottle, there's a white sediment.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.48,0:29:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}瓶子底部有白色沉淀物
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.56,0:29:13.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can see this actually on camera I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.56,0:29:13.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这些也可以拿来做鸡尾酒... - 我觉得你可以在镜头前看到
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.40,0:29:17.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So that sediment, Rick, is that an indication
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.40,0:29:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 里克 这些沉淀物
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.32,0:29:17.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}表明
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.56,0:29:20.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- that this bottle was affected? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.56,0:29:20.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这一瓶受到了影响?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.20,0:29:21.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yes? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.20,0:29:21.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.56,0:29:26.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the degree to which it has become explosive
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.56,0:29:26.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 它可能发生爆炸的程度
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.68,0:29:29.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}depends upon how much sugar has been eaten
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.68,0:29:29.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}取决于底部的微生物
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.76,0:29:32.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}by whatever microorganisms are sitting there at the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.76,0:29:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}消耗了多少糖分
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.32,0:29:34.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That sediment at the bottom is eating the sugar?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.32,0:29:34.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}瓶子底部的沉淀物在消耗糖分?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.48,0:29:36.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. So that's devouring the sweetness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.48,0:29:36.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 它正在吞噬糖分 使其变成干苹果酒
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.84,0:29:40.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So it's turning it into a dry cider. A drier cider than it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.84,0:29:40.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 比它本该有的更干 - 并且如你所说
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.20,0:29:43.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And also turning it into, as you say, a Mills hand grenade.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.20,0:29:43.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 把它变成了米尔斯手榴弹 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.44,0:29:44.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.20,0:29:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}豪客斯通拉格啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.08,0:29:47.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The next job was to get a warning message out to the public
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.08,0:29:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“好家伙 这酒好喝”
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.04,0:29:51.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as quickly as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.04,0:29:50.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下一项工作是尽快向公众
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.00,0:29:51.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}发布警告信息
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.32,0:29:56.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And since there was no time to call in a professional PR firm,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.32,0:29:56.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}由于没时间联系专业的公关公司
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.72,0:29:59.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I did the wording myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.72,0:29:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我自己组织了语言
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.32,0:30:04.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, what I've written is:
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.32,0:30:04.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我写的是
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.00,0:30:07.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.00,0:30:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“完了 完了 完了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.56,0:30:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"There's been a massive cock-up, and as a result there's a very slim chance
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.56,0:30:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“酒里有一大堆不好的东西 因此
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.64,0:30:13.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"some of our Hawkstone cider bottles",
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.64,0:30:13.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我们的豪客斯通苹果酒 有极小的可能...”
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.64,0:30:15.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I put "cider" in capital letters,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.64,0:30:15.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我专门强调了苹果酒
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.24,0:30:18.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"might, there's no easy way of saying this, explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.24,0:30:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“...此话说来不易 但它可能爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.16,0:30:23.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"If the cap has the code L3160, open it underwater,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.16,0:30:23.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“如果瓶盖上的代码为‘L3160’ 只能在水下开瓶
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.12,0:30:25.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"pour it away, and get in touch."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.12,0:30:25.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“将酒倒掉 然后联系我们
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.44,0:30:27.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.04,0:30:31.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-"Really sorry about this." - That's gonna get the attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.04,0:30:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“对此真的非常抱歉”
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.52,0:30:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I tweeted that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.52,0:30:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这会引起注意的 - 我已经发了这条推文了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.80,0:30:37.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, that is putting your hands up in the headmaster's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.80,0:30:37.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就像是在校长办公室里举手说
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.48,0:30:40.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-"Sir, I've been smoking." - Before you've been caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.48,0:30:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“先生 我一直在抽烟”
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.08,0:30:40.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而你明明还没被逮到
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.12,0:30:47.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Cidergate had taken up valuable time,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.12,0:30:47.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“苹果酒门”事件占用了宝贵的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.16,0:30:51.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so I rushed back to resume my ditch-digging duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.16,0:30:51.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我迅速赶回去继续挖沟
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.56,0:30:55.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Come on. Come on. Come on. Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.56,0:30:55.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拜托
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.32,0:30:57.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh for Heaven's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.32,0:30:57.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.56,0:31:01.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.56,0:31:01.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.40,0:31:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Couldn't have happened on a worse day, if I'm honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.40,0:31:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 老实说 这事来得真不是时候
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.00,0:31:07.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But all right. I'll see you in half an hour. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.00,0:31:07.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不过没办法 半小时后见 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.32,0:31:11.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where are we going now? Pigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.32,0:31:11.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们现在去哪儿? - 去猪猪那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.08,0:31:12.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My pig rings have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.08,0:31:12.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的猪环到了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.76,0:31:14.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But we've got the farm-shop car park!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.76,0:31:14.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我们有好多事...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.24,0:31:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know. - It's just gonna be...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.24,0:31:16.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 得经营农场商店、修停车场 - 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.12,0:31:17.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know, Kaleb. But the pig rings have just turned up
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.12,0:31:17.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这会... - 我知道 卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.72,0:31:20.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so they've got to be fitted
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.72,0:31:20.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但做猪环的人刚刚抵达 所以必须安好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.64,0:31:23.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause the pigs are giving birth in about 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.64,0:31:23.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为猪将在20分钟后开始生产
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.04,0:31:29.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You know he's patented my idea? Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.04,0:31:29.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他拿我的想法申请了专利 - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.76,0:31:31.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's patented this idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.76,0:31:31.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他用这个想法申请了专利
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.76,0:31:34.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And he's called it the Clarkson Ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.76,0:31:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他称之为克拉克森猪环
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.88,0:31:37.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The rings!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.88,0:31:37.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪环
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.64,0:31:41.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The rings have arrived, yeah. They've arrived!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.64,0:31:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 猪环到货了 没错 - 它们到了!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.16,0:31:43.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, they're more sturdy than I thought!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.16,0:31:43.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这比我想象的更结实
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.48,0:31:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, pig. Look, it's Unit! Hello, Unit! How are you, my darling?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.48,0:31:47.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 猪猪 这是猪小队
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.48,0:31:48.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好 猪小队
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.28,0:31:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你还好吗 亲爱的?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.00,0:31:54.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So, mother pig is within the... - She's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.00,0:31:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以猪妈妈在里面...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.32,0:31:54.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它在里面
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.40,0:31:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then baby pig...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.40,0:31:55.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后小猪崽...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.68,0:32:00.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Has got a generous piglet-sized safety zone behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.68,0:32:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}后面会有宽敞 且适合猪崽大小的安全区域
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.24,0:32:02.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you impressed with this? They look good actually, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.24,0:32:02.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你对此印象如何? - 其实看起来挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.68,0:32:06.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We need to get these in 'cause we've still got a car park to build.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.68,0:32:04.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 得把这些放进... - 需要帮忙吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.56,0:32:06.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们要建一个停车场
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.52,0:32:08.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're in, we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.52,0:32:08.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.12,0:32:11.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hang on. Just gotta do a little lift now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.12,0:32:10.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等等
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.24,0:32:12.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在得抬起来一点 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.32,0:32:19.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.32,0:32:19.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不错
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.56,0:32:21.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Job done.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.56,0:32:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 搞定 - 我真的希望这有用
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.04,0:32:22.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I really hope these work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.84,0:32:24.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Good. Thank you. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.84,0:32:24.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.96,0:32:27.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good luck with round two. You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.96,0:32:27.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 非常感谢 - 祝你第二回合好运
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.00,0:32:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I know. I'm looking forward to it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.00,0:32:30.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不客气 - 这次我很期待
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.32,0:32:32.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was heartbreaking last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.32,0:32:32.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}上一次真是令人心碎
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.76,0:32:35.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once we'd installed the pig rings,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.76,0:32:37.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们一安装好猪环 我就查看了社交媒体
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.04,0:32:37.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I checked social media, and sure enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.60,0:32:40.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}some of our cider customers
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.60,0:32:42.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}果然 我的一些苹果酒客户 正在分享他们的想法
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.20,0:32:42.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}were sharing their thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.76,0:32:45.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的豪客斯通苹果酒只剩...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.36,0:32:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}爆炸苹果酒?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.76,0:32:51.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}豪客斯通背心即将推出
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.04,0:32:53.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}F-[bleep]-ing Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.04,0:32:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}购买了#豪客斯通3160苹果酒的人 请务必小心
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.96,0:32:52.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这可不是你以为的笑话 我的第一个错误
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.00,0:32:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Thanks a f-[bleep]-ing lot! Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.00,0:32:54.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...卡莱布 非常...感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.80,0:32:56.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.64,0:33:01.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My PR message had even made it onto the evening news.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.64,0:33:01.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的公关信息甚至上了晚间新闻
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.52,0:33:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}ITV 新闻子午线
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.24,0:33:05.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, Jeremy Clarkson's Oxfordshire farm
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.24,0:33:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在 杰里米克拉克森的 牛津郡农场召回了一批苹果酒
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.20,0:33:07.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}has recalled some of its bottles of cider,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.60,0:33:09.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}warning they could explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.60,0:33:09.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}并警告它们可能会爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.56,0:33:11.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He advises anyone who has bought some to open them underwater and...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.56,0:33:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他建议任何购买此酒的人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.56,0:33:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Running alongside the other important stories of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.56,0:33:13.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在水下打开苹果酒瓶...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.36,0:33:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}迪丽斯库阿特农场商店 这里
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.60,0:33:21.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Giant puppets have been parading through Gosport High Street.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.60,0:33:17.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}与当天的其他重要新闻并列
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.56,0:33:21.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今天下午 巨型木偶 在高斯波特高街游行
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.20,0:33:24.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Farrah, the five-metre-high fox, travelled through the town...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.20,0:33:23.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}五米高的机械狐狸法拉
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.40,0:33:25.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}沿着城镇前进...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.80,0:33:32.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}After all these distractions, it was inevitable
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.80,0:33:32.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}经过所有这些干扰后 可以预料到
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.32,0:33:36.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that at the end of play, the car park still wasn't finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.32,0:33:36.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最终停车场还没有完工
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.72,0:33:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.72,0:33:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}继续
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.20,0:33:41.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's still thick. It only needs to be very, very thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.20,0:33:41.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还是很厚 需要非常非常薄
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.52,0:33:45.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I decided that we'd carry on the next day,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.52,0:33:45.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我决定即使第二天商店会营业
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.48,0:33:49.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}even though the shop would be open for business.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.48,0:33:49.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们也得继续施工
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.08,0:33:50.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.08,0:33:50.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就这样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.88,0:33:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The following morning, Lisa and I headed over there,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.88,0:33:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天早上 丽莎和我在前往停车场的途中
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.68,0:34:00.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}discussing on the way how much she was enjoying
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.68,0:34:01.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}讨论她有多喜欢修建停车场
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.64,0:34:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}building the car park.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.92,0:34:05.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you are Irish. And I'm not being...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.92,0:34:05.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你是爱尔兰人 我不是... 我没有刻板印象
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.72,0:34:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not typecasting, but it'll be in the blood to make...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.72,0:34:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这是爱尔兰人固有的血脉...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.08,0:34:10.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you call me Liam, I will be on machinery.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.08,0:34:10.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你叫我利亚姆 我会在机器上
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.72,0:34:13.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I want to identify as an Irish builder called Liam.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.72,0:34:13.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我想以名叫利亚姆的 爱尔兰建筑工人的身份出现
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.12,0:34:14.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That would make me happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.12,0:34:14.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那会让我很开心 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.40,0:34:17.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh shit. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.40,0:34:17.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 所以 这... - 该死
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.04,0:34:17.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.96,0:34:20.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, ahem, everyone's parked in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.96,0:34:20.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}大家都把车停在里面了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.44,0:34:21.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.44,0:34:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.20,0:34:31.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Did you not tell the kids not to let people park in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.20,0:34:31.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你没跟店员交待 别让人在里面停车吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.76,0:34:34.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. It didn't occur to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.76,0:34:34.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没 我没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.88,0:34:39.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.88,0:34:39.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.76,0:34:47.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Very difficult to make a car park when it's being used as a car park.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.76,0:34:47.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里已经停上车了 很难施工了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.92,0:34:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.92,0:34:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.56,0:34:54.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know. I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.56,0:34:54.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.00,0:34:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah, look, how are we gonna do this? - I don't... Well, good que--
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.00,0:34:55.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.52,0:34:56.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- All I can say is... - I mean, he's just driven in now, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.52,0:34:56.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不...好问题...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.88,0:34:59.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Unbelievable. Look. Look! - What were they thinking of in the shop?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.88,0:34:59.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他刚刚开进来 你看 - 我只能说...难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.64,0:35:06.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So if anyone's parked in this car park, I need to start spreading gravel,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.64,0:35:02.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你看 - 他们在店里想什么呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.04,0:35:06.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把车停在这个停车上的人请注意 我得开始铺设碎石了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.28,0:35:09.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so if you wouldn't mind moving it to the overflow car park?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.28,0:35:09.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果可以的话 大家能把车移动到临时停车场吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.04,0:35:10.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got five minutes,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.04,0:35:10.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们有五分钟的时间移车
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.80,0:35:14.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}otherwise I'm gonna start and your car will be collateral damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.80,0:35:14.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}否则他们要开始施工了 而你们的车会受到附带损害
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.80,0:35:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.80,0:35:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有人吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.60,0:35:20.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyone else parked over here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.60,0:35:20.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有人把车停在这里的吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.52,0:35:22.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.52,0:35:22.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.56,0:35:24.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where have all those fucking cars come from then?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.56,0:35:24.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那这些车是哪来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.84,0:35:27.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.84,0:35:27.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.08,0:35:29.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know. Somebody's pulled in on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.08,0:35:29.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道 有人把那玩意停进来了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.28,0:35:31.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that nothing to do with us? - No, it ain't nothing to do with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.28,0:35:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那跟我们没关系吧? - 跟我们毫无关系
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.32,0:35:36.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Naturally, I wanted them to move on,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.32,0:35:36.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当然 我希望它们能开走
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.04,0:35:39.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but Alan quickly became intrigued.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.04,0:35:39.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但艾伦很快就产生了好奇
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.52,0:35:41.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What do you do? Aerating. So we go down a metre.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.52,0:35:41.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你在干什么? - 在透气
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.00,0:35:44.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We blast it with 300 PSI of air.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.00,0:35:44.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们先挖掘一米深 然后用两千千帕的空气进行喷射
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.44,0:35:47.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We then inject seaweed, which keeps it from floating under the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.44,0:35:47.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后注入海藻 以防止地面下沉
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.48,0:35:49.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We do Buckingham Palace. We've got the Royal Garden contracts.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.48,0:35:49.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们给白金汉宫服务过 有皇家花园的合约
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.96,0:35:53.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'd understood the words "Buckingham" and "Palace",
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.96,0:35:51.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 - 就在附近
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.16,0:35:53.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只听懂了“白金汉”和“宫”
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.56,0:35:56.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but as for the rest, I was completely lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.56,0:35:56.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但至于剩下的 我就完全懵了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.04,0:35:59.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We have got a six-foot clay bed. So what do you do then?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.04,0:35:59.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有一块1.8米厚的黏土层 你会怎么处理呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.40,0:36:01.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Clay's not a problem. We work everywhere in the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.40,0:36:01.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}黏土不是问题 我们经常处理黏土
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.80,0:36:03.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How do you do that then?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.80,0:36:03.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你怎么让黏土透气呢?这怎么做?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.60,0:36:06.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You will see the fissures...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.60,0:36:06.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有工作证明 你可以看到裂纹...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.04,0:36:09.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Alan said, though, I should ask the man to come back later in the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.04,0:36:09.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}艾伦说我应该让那个人 在当天晚些时候回来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.92,0:36:11.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can I leave you just a card? Would that be OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.92,0:36:11.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我给你一张名片吧
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.60,0:36:12.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.60,0:36:12.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 可以吗? - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.96,0:36:16.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So without knowing why, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.96,0:36:16.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以虽然我一头雾水 但我照做了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.96,0:36:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, that's good. I've got your card. Thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.96,0:36:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太棒了 我有你的名片了 谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.68,0:36:22.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you wouldn't mind moving? 'Cause we have to work on the car park.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.68,0:36:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不介意的话 我想请你挪一下车 因为我们得开始停车场施工了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.60,0:36:25.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hi, morning. Sorry, we've gotta do some work in the car park.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.60,0:36:23.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗨 早上好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.80,0:36:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对不起 我们得在停车场施工
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.56,0:36:28.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyone else parked here? No, you're down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.56,0:36:28.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有谁把车停在这里了? 没有 你停在那里 还有谁吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.64,0:36:32.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As we couldn't start work until Lisa had cleared out the car park,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.64,0:36:32.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}鉴于我们得等丽莎给停车场 清完场后才能开工
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.88,0:36:36.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I went off to see how the new mushroom bags were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.88,0:36:36.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我去查看新蘑菇种植袋的情况
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.96,0:36:45.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.92,0:36:49.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why are you doing this to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.92,0:36:49.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你为什么这么对我?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.32,0:36:53.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once again, I shall enter my little fungal money pit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.32,0:36:53.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要再次进入我的小真菌钱坑
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.00,0:36:59.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.20,0:37:02.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.20,0:37:02.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这让人担心
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.60,0:37:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That looks like mould. That is mould, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.60,0:37:05.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看起来像是发霉了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.48,0:37:06.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那就是霉 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.08,0:37:09.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And there's mould.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.08,0:37:09.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这发霉了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.60,0:37:11.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mould. Mould.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.60,0:37:11.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}发霉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.32,0:37:14.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's got mould, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.32,0:37:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那也发霉了 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.64,0:37:16.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's mouldy.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.64,0:37:16.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它发霉了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.16,0:37:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.16,0:37:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.08,0:37:25.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Even though we disinfected this whole area before bringing the new bags in,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.08,0:37:23.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以这...尽管我们 在把新的种植袋拿进来前
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.88,0:37:25.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对整个区域进行了消毒
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.08,0:37:29.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it was obviously left over somehow from the previous crop.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.08,0:37:29.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但显然不知为何 还有上一批留下的残留物
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.76,0:37:32.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.76,0:37:32.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.08,0:37:36.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And this is the fan that's keeping the air moving to try and stop the mould.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.08,0:37:34.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是风扇
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.60,0:37:37.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用来保持空气流通以避免发霉
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.60,0:37:41.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.40,0:37:44.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, my giddy aunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.40,0:37:44.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的妈呀
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.52,0:37:46.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.52,0:37:46.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看这里面
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.00,0:37:51.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.00,0:37:51.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.12,0:37:53.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna be sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.12,0:37:53.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.16,0:37:56.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, that smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.16,0:37:56.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那味道
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.64,0:38:03.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once I'd removed the contaminated produce,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.64,0:38:03.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我清除了受污染的农产品后
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.96,0:38:06.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I totted up the damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.96,0:38:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}立刻统计了受损情况
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.92,0:38:10.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got 68 bags here
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.92,0:38:10.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里有68袋
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.76,0:38:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which are very obviously ruined, full of mould.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.76,0:38:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}显然这些都已经毁了 全都长满了霉
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.56,0:38:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And 68 bags times 17
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.56,0:38:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}68乘以17
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.56,0:38:22.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is a loss of £1,156.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.56,0:38:22.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}损失了1156英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.00,0:38:26.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Plus, each bag would have produced,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.00,0:38:26.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}另外 每袋平均
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.48,0:38:31.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}on average, let's say two kilogrammes of mushrooms,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.48,0:38:31.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可以产两千克蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.16,0:38:33.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which I would sell for...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.16,0:38:35.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我可以卖16英镑...32英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.48,0:38:35.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£16... £32.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.32,0:38:39.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So this is a financial disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.32,0:38:39.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以损失惨重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.16,0:38:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.64,0:38:50.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm having a horrible day!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.64,0:38:50.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我今天真是太倒霉了!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.16,0:38:56.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't let this go near nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.16,0:38:56.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不能让它接近大自然
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.68,0:38:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.40,0:39:01.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What the bloody hell do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.40,0:39:01.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.56,0:39:08.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I decided the only solution for the diseased pipe
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.56,0:39:08.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我决定唯一的解决方案是
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.28,0:39:11.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was to take inspiration from the movie Goodfellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.28,0:39:11.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从电影《好家伙》里汲取灵感
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.84,0:39:18.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right. We've gone through the topsoil. We're into the clay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.84,0:39:18.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 我们已经挖穿了表层土 挖到了黏土
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.20,0:39:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not gonna bury it until I can see the tips
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.20,0:39:21.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要把它
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.92,0:39:24.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}of the Sydney Opera House down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.92,0:39:24.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}埋得非常深才行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.92,0:39:29.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Quicklime.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.92,0:39:29.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}生石灰
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.16,0:39:33.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I have no idea what this does, but I've seen Joe Pesci use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.16,0:39:33.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道这是干什么用的 但我看见乔佩西用过它
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.68,0:39:41.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}For belt and braces, I then buried the equally mouldy filter
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.68,0:39:41.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为了确保安全 我把同样发霉的过滤器
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.32,0:39:43.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}more than a mile away.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.32,0:39:43.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}埋在了两公里外
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.92,0:39:56.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.92,0:39:56.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}糟心玩意!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.84,0:39:59.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.44,0:40:07.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The world is safe thanks to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.44,0:40:07.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}多亏了我 世界才安全
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.40,0:40:10.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}By the time I'd buried the equipment,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.40,0:40:10.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我把设备埋起来
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.44,0:40:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}showered, disinfected my hair and put on new clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.44,0:40:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}洗澡 然后给头发消了毒 并穿上新衣服后
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.28,0:40:18.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the man with the incomprehensible machine had returned...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.28,0:40:18.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那个带有令人费解的机器的人 已经回来了...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.48,0:40:22.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...and started work.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.48,0:40:22.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且开始了工作
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.56,0:40:39.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}At first, I thought they were fracking,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.56,0:40:39.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}起初 我以为他们在做水力压裂
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.32,0:40:42.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}but eventually, the penny started to drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.32,0:40:42.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但最终 真相浮出了水面
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.92,0:40:48.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They've drilled a hole down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.92,0:40:48.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他们在那里钻了一个洞
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.64,0:40:50.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}blasted air into it,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.64,0:40:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}向其中注入空气
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.56,0:40:55.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which has caused fractures to go out six metres in the rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.56,0:40:54.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}导致岩石中的裂缝
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.64,0:40:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}向外延伸了六米
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.84,0:40:59.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then they fill that with seaweed to keep it open.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.84,0:40:59.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 他们用海藻填充 以保持其开放
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.96,0:41:04.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then the water, not just today but forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.96,0:41:06.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 水 不仅仅是今天 会一直在黏土里流淌
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.96,0:41:06.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}will drain through the clay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.96,0:41:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause this has been the bane of our lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.96,0:41:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为这已经是...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.44,0:41:11.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}this flooding up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.44,0:41:11.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们生活的祸根 这里充斥着洪水
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.52,0:41:17.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow! What a shot! What a shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.52,0:41:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 真不错! - 那是核心 保持其开放
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.12,0:41:19.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That's insane! Brilliant. You watch again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.12,0:41:19.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 太疯狂了! - 太棒了 你再看一次
