Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.52,0:41:49.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}搞什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.76,0:41:54.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Did anyone else just see that?
