Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.64,0:41:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, we heard it. We heard it. Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.64,0:41:56.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 没 我们听到了 - 我们听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.64,0:41:57.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}难以置信
