Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.76,0:43:08.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.76,0:43:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊
