Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.76,0:43:10.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是跟西蒙的唯一区别
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.92,0:43:13.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so he can get that feel for his...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.92,0:43:13.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为这样他才能让那块地再次放牧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.28,0:43:15.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The old wine. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.28,0:43:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 在路上 没错 - 不 我知道 我也不行
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.48,0:43:17.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I know, nor me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.16,0:43:22.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Having dropped him off, I went to pick up the goats,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.16,0:43:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把他送到以后 我去接山羊了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.44,0:43:26.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because I'd come up with a new business plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.44,0:43:26.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我有了一个新的商业计划
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.16,0:43:31.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, I bought the goats to
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.16,0:43:31.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我之前买了山羊来清理
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.92,0:43:35.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}clear a bank of brambles that the machine wasn't able to do
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.92,0:43:35.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}机器无法清理的荆棘 因为那个堤坝太陡了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.76,0:43:39.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause the bank was too steep, which is just at the bottom of this hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.76,0:43:39.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它就在这山脚下
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.04,0:43:42.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, they still aren't big enough to do that.
