Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.48,0:43:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, how's this for a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.48,0:43:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 这个计划是
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.00,0:43:46.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm renting them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.00,0:43:46.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我把它们租出去
