Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.88,0:43:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后它们会长大 到了明年
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.12,0:44:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll put them down there and they'll get on with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.12,0:44:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就让它们下去 开始清理荆棘
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.20,0:44:08.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My first customer was a friend who owned a bit of land next to mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.20,0:44:04.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}查德灵顿 请缓慢驾驶
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.60,0:44:08.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的第一个客户 是我农场旁边一块地的所有者
