Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.36,0:44:11.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这一直有点尴尬
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.04,0:44:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'cause I used to think this bit of ground through here was mine and it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.04,0:44:14.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我以前以为这块土地是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.20,0:44:15.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但并不是
