Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.20,0:44:20.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我必须来这里见我朋友的土地经纪人
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.96,0:44:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I'm a bit late. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.96,0:44:31.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我来迟了一点
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.20,0:44:32.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好?
