Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.24,0:44:35.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.12,0:44:38.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.12,0:44:38.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你好
