Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.08,0:44:40.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你在这里干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.92,0:44:44.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I look after, you know, the client here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.92,0:44:44.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这...我也负责照顾这位客户
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.68,0:44:46.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.68,0:44:46.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.00,0:44:47.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was you?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.00,0:44:47.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是你?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.20,0:44:51.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, I-- - How are we going to negotiate a price?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.20,0:44:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我...
