Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.08,0:44:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那我们怎么谈价格?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.96,0:44:56.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Slight?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.96,0:44:55.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我确实发现这有点冲突
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.16,0:44:56.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有点?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.68,0:44:59.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much-- Okay, then, Charlie,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.68,0:44:59.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那多少钱?好吧 查理
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.40,0:45:02.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}how much is the nameless er...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.40,0:45:02.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这块土地的... - 取决于...
