Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.64,0:45:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...无名主人 要付我多少租山羊的费用?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.44,0:45:06.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pay you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.44,0:45:06.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}付你费用?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.76,0:45:09.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, look at all the wonderful forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.76,0:45:09.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看这些美味的饲料
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.48,0:45:13.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The browse... You know, all that value sitting before you,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.48,0:45:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你面前 你眼前的这些 供动物吃的植物 这些东西的价值
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.04,0:45:14.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}before your eyes.
