Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.64,0:45:21.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你来围栏的这边 跨过这个围栏
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.60,0:45:25.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much? - There's not much value out there.
