Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.60,0:45:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那他应该付我多少钱? - 他应该支付
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.08,0:45:38.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}five or six pence a day per goat.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.08,0:45:38.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}每只山羊每天五、六便士
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.84,0:45:41.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Pence? - Per day, per goat. It soon adds up.
